msgid "games.bfbc2.objective.conquest"
msgstr ""
"Capture and hold the control points. Each respawn costs a team a ticket, and"
" the team holding fewer points also loses tickets over time; the first team "
"to run out loses the round."

msgid "games.bfbc2.objective.rush"
msgstr ""
"The attackers arm and destroy the defenders' M-COM stations, two at a time; "
"each pair destroyed opens the next base. The attackers lose when they run "
"out of tickets, the defenders when the last pair falls."

msgid "games.bfbc2.objective.squad-rush"
msgstr ""
"One attacking squad against one defending squad: the attackers destroy one "
"M-COM station in each base before they run out of tickets."

msgid "games.bfbc2.objective.squad-deathmatch"
msgstr ""
"Four squads fight each other; the first squad to reach the kill target wins "
"the round."

